[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0225","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1960","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey QCMS颜色管理库越界读取漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x至13.0、Thunderbird 5.0至13.0及SeaMonkey 2.11之前版本中的QCMS颜色管理库实现中，qcms_transform_data_rgb_out_lut_sse2函数存在越界读取漏洞。当处理特制的颜色配置文件（color profile）时，程序未能正确验证输入数据的边界，导致在SSE2优化路径中发生越界内存读取。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的颜色配置文件，诱使用户在受影响浏览器中打开包含该配置文件的图片或网页，从而触发越界读取操作，导致进程内存中的敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1960"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-18T10:26:48Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:40Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 14.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 14.0 及以上版本、SeaMonkey 至 2.11 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可在浏览器设置中禁用色彩管理功能（gfx.color_management.enabled 设为 false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00013.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00016.html","http://osvdb.org/84010","http://secunia.com/advisories/49965","http://secunia.com/advisories/49968","http://secunia.com/advisories/49972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49993","http://secunia.com/advisories/49994","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-50.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54572","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027256","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027257","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027258","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-2","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1510-1","http://www.xerox.com/download/security/security-bulletin/16287-4d6b7b0c81f7b/cert_XRX13-003_v1.0.pdf","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=761014","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16735","https://