rbird ESR 升级至 10.0.6 及以上版本；SeaMonkey 升级至 2.11 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00013.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00016.html","http://osvdb.org/84002","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1088.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49965","http://secunia.com/advisories/49968","http://secunia.com/advisories/49972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49977","http://secunia.com/advisories/49979","http://secunia.com/advisories/49992","http://secunia.com/advisories/49993","http://secunia.com/advisories/49994","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-49.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54576","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027256","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027257","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027258","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-2","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1510-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=737559","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=754044","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16920","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-1959.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1959.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1959.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1959","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1959","https://github.com/mabitoski/